{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "77d31902a22b5a20cd9e02b9f4a46cd3d4784342a879ffe65f8ceaf5f49e7d69", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}。\nちょっといい？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
