{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_1005", "source_sha256": "ef8dea665ba3cc9c5f6f9144b63992a9044d5ee9e19c62c42cea22f392be7294", "ja": "かわいい！", "zh": "好可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4cea0b648c59e5c663dfb46343015ceb02a9a1305895b82e55e4a1cdd3c829a3", "ja": "すごくいいと思うよ！　いつもの服もいいけど、\nこういう可愛い服もよく似合うな！", "zh": "我觉得特别棒！平时的衣服也很好看，不过，\n这种可爱的衣服也很适合你啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "685b628e8b6f08f90da81d5724063cedcf90c52d2498d25dde453eb1961b1b33", "ja": "ほ、ほんと？　……はあ～。良かった～。", "zh": "真、真的吗？……呼～太好了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2002_p", "source_sha256": "8071c99d16430552994792ec358a4549e02fec176030a4fe49f9136911ef2023", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か？", "zh": "没、没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2003_029umi", "source_sha256": "bdf86217a5763aae660db51405ae900dec258e59c200496c844803a8e2325c16", "ja": "えへへ……。私がこの服を考えた時、\n願望？みたいなのを、いーっぱい詰め込んだの。", "zh": "诶嘿嘿……我设计这套衣服的时候，\n把很多……像是愿望一样的东西，全都塞进去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "22920adfbd59b07b842d5b9f4f748737617e2fcccc2aa088e74baeccce4fb455", "ja": "だから自分では「すっごくかわいいー☆」って\n思ってるし、大好きな服なんだけど……。", "zh": "所以我自己觉得“超级可爱——☆”，\n也是我最喜欢的服装，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2005_029umi", "source_sha256": "6552ec920a4a05cf1ad0c8bc8b33df51ff269de9947daa2fe52e9203ed5746b9", "ja": "いざ、{$P$}に見せるぞ！\nって思ったら、なんか心配になっちゃって。", "zh": "可真要想拿给{$P$}看的时候，\n又莫名觉得有些担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2006_p", "source_sha256": "35d2984ebff30152557b742b00d13213610e73524342847d8397330a193ca2b5", "ja": "なるほど……。そういうことなら、\n心配しなくて大丈夫だ。すごく可愛いからな！", "zh": "原来如此……既然是这样，\n不用担心。真的非常可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2007_p", "source_sha256": "2c228e5f145cc539edb31ce90457377aca39d991e5635ae21262306a33dabe5d", "ja": "なんていうか、女子力が高そうな感じがする。", "zh": "该怎么说呢，总觉得很有女人味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2008_029umi", "source_sha256": "9cc59aab2eb00cdfad57d6c9a61d06e891779281d0cf20b4f1067a48118228ca", "ja": "えっ？\n{$P$}……すごいねぇ～！", "zh": "诶？\n{$P$}……感觉好厉害呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2009_p", "source_sha256": "f9af74d15dd5bd7d13f7b0c9ec9e47ab4000cabc068a2174a05d5cc2f64eeb51", "ja": "すごいって、何がだ？", "zh": "你说厉害，具体是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2010_029umi", "source_sha256": "d5f30f8ec45f881dd3ab9fbd69264c4d0bc6d70f8da403a27e5d35dfe7f8f2d6", "ja": "今、「女子力が高そう」って言ったでしょ？\nそれっ！　私がすっごくこだわったところなんだ～！", "zh": "你刚才说“看起来很有女子力”，对吧？\n就是那个！那可是我特别花心思的地方～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "dc3ee5ec0c58973750086c7df5d1104fb0d369e61774375c4e11474eea17a4fb", "ja": "もし私が着るなら……って、イメージした時、\nやっぱり『女子力全開☆』って感じがいいなって♪", "zh": "在想象“如果是我来穿的话……”时，果然还是觉得“女孩子魅力全开☆”的感觉最好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2012_p", "source_sha256": "1f5f50c5367f5aeabab7e078ca5cb7ee87329e0980eac591e10f0bb2aead85d7", "ja": "そうだったのか。それなら、海美の狙い通りだな。\nちゃんと女子力が高そうに見えるよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。那就正如海美所计划的那样。\n看起来确实很有女子力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2013_029umi", "source_sha256": "68f507ed0cba54f05c43d4b0f663868271a6900124e01ceb55eda9bad48a5e0a", "ja": "えへへ、そうかな～！　それじゃそれじゃ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是这样吗～！那就那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0674_2014_029umi", "source_sha256": "f7d1ca31de9518ab3e7e52250a9a6655c22035981ff8ab9b951794bf7546dbdc", "ja": "この服なら、{$P$}の隣に並んでも\n大人と子供！って感じにならないかな～？", "zh": "穿这身衣服的话，和{$P$}站在一起，就不会给人一种大人和小孩的感觉了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
